The solution involves 

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.291
multiple steps and make sure
 to watch the video until the end,

00:00:15.541 --> 00:00:19.875
because I used a method that allowed me
 to get the first blood on the challenge

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:25.916
because I was able to exfiltrate the flag 95%
 faster than the naive solution.

00:00:26.375 --> 00:00:28.250
And that number is not a bait. 

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.416
It's an actual calculation -
 you will see for yourself.

